[1256.973639, "o", "7).\r\n58:     - Income test: Bob has no income under §152(d)(1)(B) (line 156).\r\n59:     - Qualifying child test: Bob cannot be a qualifying child because §152(c)(2)(B) only includes \"child of taxpayer or descendant\" - Bob is Alice's FATHER, not her child.\r\n60:     - Therefore Bob is not a qualifying child under §152(d)(1)(D) (line 157-158).\r\n63:4. Phaseout calculation (§151(d)(3)):\r\n68:   - Applicable percentage under §151(d)(3)(B) (line 86): 25 × 2% = 50%.\r\n76:6. Tax calculation (§1 (c)(v) - line 36):\r\n"]
